        {
          "_name": "people4",
          "_sourceTheme": "bistrom5",
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "overflow": "hidden",
            "position": "relative",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            ".shape_img when (@showShapeImg)": {
              "position": "absolute",
              "z-index": "2",
              "top": "30px",
              "right": "-10%",
              "width": "150px",
              "img": {
                "width": "100%",
                "height": "auto",
                "object-fit": "contain"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                "display": "none"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "align-items": "center"
            },
            ".shape_left": {
              "width": "25%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "left": "0",
              "bottom": "0",
              "z-index": "0",
              "background-color": "@shapeColorLeft"
            },
            ".shape_right": {
              "width": "15%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "20%",
              "right": "0",
              "bottom": "0",
              "z-index": "0",
              "background-color": "@shapeColorRight"
            },
            ".content_box": {
              "position": "relative",
              "z-index": "3"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "margin-bottom": "21px",
              "color": "#202020",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "margin-bottom": "21px"
            },
            ".image-wrapper, img": {
              "width": "100%"
            },
            ".image-wrapper": {
              "position": "relative",
              "z-index": "1"
            },
            ".iconfont-wrapper": {
              "color": "contrast(@iconsColor) !important",
              "font-size": "17px",
              "margin-right": "25px",
              "&:last-child when (@iconsAmount > '3')": {
                "margin-right": "0"
              },
              "&:nth-child(3) when (@iconsAmount = '3')": {
                "margin-right": "0"
              },
              "&:nth-child(2) when (@iconsAmount = '2')": {
                "margin-right": "0"
              },
              "&:nth-child(1) when (@iconsAmount = '1')": {
                "margin-right": "0"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 1399px)": {
                "margin-right": "5px"
              },
              "width": "56px",
              "height": "56px",
              "background-color": "@iconsColor",
              "border-radius": "50%",
              "display": "inline-flex",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "align-items": "center",
              "transition": "all 0.2s ease-in-out",
              "&:hover": {
                "background-color": "darken(@iconsColor, 5%)"
              }
            },
            ".icons_card": {
              "margin-top": "35px",
              "padding": "0",
              "text-align": "center"
            },
            "@media (min-width: 991px)": {
              ".content_box": {
                "padding": "0 5rem 0 1rem"
              },
              ".image_left": {
                "padding-top": "5rem"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".row": {
                "flex-direction": "column"
              },
              ".content_box": {
                "padding": "3rem 0"
              }
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".shape": {
                "display": "none"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text, .icons_card": {
              "text-align": "center"
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"people4 bistro_people\" group=\"People\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background':bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"!fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"!fullScreen\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Shape\" name=\"showShapeImg\">\n        <header>Background Shape</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Shape\" name=\"showShape\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Left\" value=\"#c4c4c8\" name=\"shapeColorLeft\" condition=\"showShape\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Right\" value=\"#8b0000\" name=\"shapeColorRight\" condition=\"showShape\">\n        <header>Icons</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Icons\" name=\"showIcons\" checked>\n        <select title=\"Amount\" name=\"iconsAmount\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\">2</option>\n            <option value=\"3\" selected>3</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">4</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"iconsColor\" value=\"#8b0000\" condition=\"showIcons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"shape shape_left\" mbr-if=\"showShape\"></div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container' : !fullWidth, 'container-fluid' : fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-5 offset-lg-1\">\n                <div class=\"image-wrapper image_left\">\n                    <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/whatsapp-image-2022-05-31-at-3.31.36-pm-1036x1381.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-4 offset-lg-1\">\n                <div class=\"content_box text-center\">\n                    <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\"><b>Certified Small Business</b></h1>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .icons_card\">We specialize in residential &amp; commercial interior &amp; exterior painting &amp; pressure washing. This includes cabinet painting and all forms of pressure washing and soft washing (concrete, lanai, sidewalks, driveways...etc.).<br><br>MSG PC was officially launched by Michael &amp; Shannon in October of 2006 during a time of severe economic housing crisis. Despite all odds, we grew exponentially over the course of just a few years, and without fail, continued to have the utmost success, even to the point of profitable growth and expansion throughout the 2020 Covid Pandemic.&nbsp;<br></p>\n                    <div class=\"shape_img\" mbr-if=\"showShapeImg\">\n                        <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/msg%202022%20logo%20transparent%20large-300x147.png\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"icons_card\" mbr-if=\"showIcons\">\n                        <a class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/MSGPaintingConstruction/\" target=\"_blank\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-facebook socicon\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/msg-painting-construction\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"iconsAmount > 1\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-linkedin socicon\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/msgpainting/\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"iconsAmount > 2\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-instagram socicon\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                        <a class=\"iconfont-wrapper\" href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@msgpainting\" target=\"_blank\" mbr-if=\"iconsAmount > 3\">\n                            <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon-tiktok socicon\"></span>\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"shape shape_right\" mbr-if=\"showShape\"></div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_anchor": "people4-2i",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "t4HvAkg7o5",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "article1",
          "_sourceTheme": "motionm5",
          "_styles": {
            "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
            "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)",
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@reverseContent)": {
              ".row": {
                "flex-direction": "row-reverse"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
              "margin-bottom": ".75rem",
              "line-height": "1",
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "margin-bottom": "1.25rem",
              "color": "#8b0000"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "margin-top": "12px",
              "margin-bottom": "1.5rem",
              "letter-spacing": "-0.025em",
              "color": "#000000"
            },
            ".content_box": {
              "max-width": "42rem"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".mbr-section-subtitle": {
                "margin-bottom": ".25rem"
              },
              ".mbr-text": {
                "margin-top": "0",
                "margin-bottom": "1rem"
              }
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article1\" group=\"Article\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background':bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"reverseContent\" title=\"Reverse\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" value=\"8\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Link\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/background.jpg\">\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.2\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle || showTitle\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style ls-1\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">——————</h4>\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style ls-1\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">Our Promise</h3>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-lg-1 d-none d-lg-block\"></div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <div class=\"content_box\">\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>Quality</b>: Here at MSG PC, we prefer quality over quantity. While we work very hard to complete your projects in a timely manner, we will never overlook the quality of the finished work in order to “get to the next job.” We pride ourselves on the “little touches” so at the end of the day, your home or building meets the same qualifications as if it were our own.\n<br><b>Integrity</b>: We believe in “from the top down.” If the leadership of our company operates in integrity, high moral character, and honesty with our clients, that mentality should filter down to the rest of our team. Our reputation with our clients and the vendors we work with are what matters to us. We have and will continue to successfully build our business structure upon that quality.\n<br><b>Partnership</b>: As painting and construction contractors, our mission is to make your thoughts and ideas a reality. We will work with you every step of the way to make this process as simple, easy, affordable and productive as possible! Let us partner with your vision and make it flourish!\n<br><b>Work Ethic</b>: MSG Painting &amp; Softwash Co. was built on the foundation of unparalleled dedication to hard work. Our commitment can be seen in our leadership and is wholeheartedly etched into our corporate identity as well as our peers and community.\n<br><b>Innovation</b>: We are at the forefront of offering the highest quality of materials, workmanship, application and final appearance package in our industry. We do not use “cheap products.” Here at MSG PC we want to continuously grow in our knowledge base across all areas of our business structure and we continue to strive for the most innovative ideas to make that growth possible. Whether it be marketing, technology, financing, or simply educating our customers in regards to products, materials, and services. If we don’t have the answer, we will do everything in our power to find the RIGHT one for you! That is our promise!&nbsp;<br></p>\n                    <p class=\"linkBtn mb-0 mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".linkBtn\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-primary\">Show More</a></p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "article1-11",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "sUr0CxQldM",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "_name": "header9",
          "_sourceTheme": "appm5",
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
