tle=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n\t\t\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n\n\n\t<div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"mbr-black col-md-12 col-lg-10\">\n\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"card\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"user_text pb-3\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-quote-left mobi-mbri\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); fill: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></span>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".user_text\">We were very pleased with the results of two interior painting projects completed by MSG in our home. They were very prompt with our estimate requests which were detailed and reasonably priced. Both jobs were completed within the time estimated and they were very professional, friendly and courteous. We have recommended their services to our family and friends, and plan on using Mike and Shannon for an exterior painting project later this year.<br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"align\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h4 mbr-text class=\"user_name mbr-bold mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".user_name, .align\">ROB AND WENDI HERRICK, PMP<br>Fenton, Michigan<br></h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t</div>\n</section>",
