Amount == '2',\n                                                'col-lg-6': cardsAmount =='1'}\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 3\">\n                                        <div class=\"wrapper\">\n                                            <div class=\"img align-left\" mbr-if=\"swIcon\">\n                                                <span class=\"mbr-iconfont mbrib-magic-stick\" mbr-icon></span>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-card-title align-left pb-2\" data-app-selector=\".tab-pane .wrapper .mbr-card-title, .img\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Pathology </h4>\n                                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style align-left\" data-app-selector=\".tab-pane .wrapper .mbr-text, .img\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                                Lorem ipsum dolor amet, consecte tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore tumber tur adipisicing elit.</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div aria-labelledby=\"tech-tab5\" class=\"tab-pane\" id=\"tech-tab5-content\" mbr-if=\"bootstrapTabs > 4\" role=\"tabpanel\">\n                        <div class=\"row\">\n                            <div class=\"col-md-12\">\n                                <img mbr-if=\"showTabImage\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/whatsapp-image-2023-01-20-at-10.09.26-am-1024x576.jpg\" alt>\n                                <h2 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-section-title align-left mbr-bold\" data-app-selector=\".tab-content .tab-pane .mbr-section-title\" mbr-if=\"showTabTitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\">\n                                    <a href=\"https://msgsoftwash.com\" class=\"text-primary\" target