lendide scriptorem nec ea.</p>\n                                <div class=\"cards-wrap row mt-5\" mbr-if=\"showTabCards\">\n                                    <div class=\"col-md-6 row-item\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                                                'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3',\n                                                'col-lg-6': cardsAmount == '2',\n                                                'col-lg-6': cardsAmount =='1'}\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 0\">\n                                        <div class=\"wrapper\">\n                                            <div class=\"img align-left\" mbr-if=\"swIcon\">\n                                                <span class=\"mbr-iconfont mbrib-hot-cup\" mbr-icon></span>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-card-title align-left pb-2\" data-app-selector=\".tab-pane .wrapper .mbr-card-title, .img\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Infusion Therapy </h4>\n\n                                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style align-left\" data-app-selector=\".tab-pane .wrapper .mbr-text, .img\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                                Lorem ipsum dolor amet, consecte tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore tumber tur adipisicing elit.</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"col-md-6 row-item\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                                                'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3',\n                                                'col-lg-6': cardsAmount == '2',\n                                                'col-lg-6': cardsAmount =='1'}\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n                                        <div class=\"wrapper\">\n                                            <div class=\"img align-left\" mbr-if=\"swIcon\">\n                                                <span class=\"mbr-iconfont mbrib-rocket\" mbr-icon></span>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-card-title align-left pb-2\" data-app-selector=\".tab-pane .wrapper .mbr-card-title, .img\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Infectious Diseases</h4>\n\n                                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style align-left\" data-app-selector=\".tab-pane .wrapper .mbr-text, .img\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                                Lorem ipsum dolor amet, consecte tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore tumber tur adipisicing elit.</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"col-md-6 row-item\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                                                'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3',\n                                                'col-lg-6': cardsAmount == '2',\n                                                'col-lg-6': cardsAmount =='1'}\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 2\">\n                                        <div class=\"wrapper\">\n                                            <div class=\"img align-left\" mbr-if=\"swIcon\">\n                                                <span class=\"mbr-iconfont mbrib-trash\" mbr-icon></span>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-card-title align-left pb-2\" data-app-selector=\".tab-pane .wrapper .mbr-card-title, .img\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">Hospital Medicine </h4>\n                                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style align-left\" data-app-selector=\".tab-pane .wrapper .mbr-text, .img\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                                Lorem ipsum dolor amet, consecte tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore tumber tur adipisicing elit.</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n\n                                    <div class=\"col-md-6 row-item\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-3': cardsAmount == '4',\n                                                'col-lg-4': cardsAmount == '3',\n                                                'col-lg-6': cardsAmount == '2',\n                                                'col-lg-6': cardsAmount =='1'}\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 3\">\n                                        <div class=\"wrapper\">\n                                            <div class=\"img align-left\" mbr-if=\"swIcon\">\n                                                <span class=\"mbr-iconfont mbrib-magic-stick\" mbr-icon></span>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <h4 class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-card-title align-left pb-2\" data-app-selector=\".tab-pane .wrapper .mbr-card-title, .img\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n                                                Hematology/Oncology</h4>\n                                            <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style align-left\" data-app-selector=\".tab-pane .wrapper .mbr-text, .img\" mbr-if=\"showCardText\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\">\n                                                Lorem ipsum dolor amet, consecte tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore tumber tur adipisicing elit.</p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div